    "rich_text_Tgxhai": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_qn8iqA": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Hard Water Is Hurting Your Home",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_Cbbz7x": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Hard water silently damages your bathroom fittings, geysers, pipelines, washing machines, taps, and shower heads every single day. White stains on tiles, clogged faucets, reduced appliance life, and rough water quality are all signs of hard water entering your home through the overhead water tank.</p><p>Scale-O is a <strong>salt-free water softener</strong> for overhead tanks designed specifically for independent houses, villas, bungalows, and whole house water systems. It helps reduce hard water scaling without chemicals, salt, electricity, or complicated installation.</p><h3>Why Homeowners Choose Scale-O</h3><ul><li><strong>Salt-free water softener</strong></li><li>DIY installation in overhead tanks</li><li>No plumbing modification required</li><li>Suitable for whole house water supply</li><li>Designed for houses & bungalows</li><li>Low maintenance hard water solution</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "button_BA9yrL": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "button_label": "Get Scale-O",
            "button_link": "shopify://collections/water-softeners",
            "button_style": "m-button--secondary",
            "button_size": "m-button--small"
          }
        }
      },
