    "rich_text_J3rhqd": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_9ajFWY": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>Why Scale-O Is Unique</h3><ul><li>No salt required</li><li>No electricity required</li><li>DIY installation</li><li>No water wastage</li><li>No maintenance hassles</li><li>Suitable for all types of water tanks</li><li>Works for whole house water supply</li></ul><h3>Perfect For:</h3><ul><li>Independent houses</li><li>Villas</li><li>Bungalows</li><li>Duplex homes</li><li>Row houses</li><li>Farmhouses</li></ul><h2>Choose Scale-O by Storage & Usage</h2><p>Select the right <strong>hard water softener for tank</strong> systems based on your overhead tank size and daily household water consumption.</p><h2><a href=\"/products/scale-o-mini\" title=\"Mini Water Softener\">Scale-O Mini Water Softener</a></h2><h3>Best Water Softener for Small Families</h3><p>The Scale-O Mini is a compact and efficient water softener designed for small homes, and families with lower daily water usage. It helps reduce hard water scaling in bathrooms, taps, showers, geysers, and washing machines while improving overall water quality for everyday use.</p><p>Perfect for compact spaces, the Scale-O Mini fits easily with overhead tank setups and offers a low-maintenance solution for hard water problems.</p><h3>Why Choose Scale-O Mini?</h3><ul><li>Compact space-saving design</li><li>Helps protect bathroom fittings & appliances</li><li>Reduces white scaling caused by hard water</li><li>No maintenance required</li></ul>"
          }
        }
      },
